Package: opensurge
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: OpenSurge maintainers <opensurge@example.invalid>
Depends: adduser
Description: OpenSurge Linux gateway installed by its verified installer
 OpenSurge provides a Linux gateway data plane and a LAN HTTPS control plane.
 Install and upgrade this package through opensurge-install, which verifies the
 release and coordinates host dependencies. The package alone does not
 configure or start the gateway.
